[stderr] index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..80b9199a22884f3ba1a05ef471920526a4e70852
[stderr] --- /dev/null
[stderr] +++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/04-audio-direction.md
[stderr] @@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
[stderr] +# 04 — Audio direction
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Audio is original, optional, captioned/described where it conveys state, and
[stderr] +always paired with a visual/text equivalent. No chant, anthem, broadcast,
[stderr] +club, or game imitation is permitted.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +| ID | Cue group | Intent |
[stderr] +| --- | --- | --- |
[stderr] +| AUDIO-001 | Entry and round bed | Restrained, low-distraction electronic percussion with abstract crowd-energy texture; optional and volume-controlled. |
[stderr] +| AUDIO-002 | Answer and streak feedback | Brief distinct correct, incorrect, and streak cues using claps and soft brass-like synth accents without sampled sports expression. |
[stderr] +| AUDIO-003 | Results and completion | Warm, short celebratory sting that supports rather than replaces the readable results state. |
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Final durations, quantities, loudness targets, loop policy, and generated-cue
[stderr] +selection need production approval; no audio is generated by this plan.
