assets in authoring.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0005\",\"IMP-0011\",\"IMP-0013\",\"IMP-0014\",\"IMP-0015\",\"IMP-0016\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"content/campaign/\",\"assets/source-manifest.*\",\"tests/content/campaign*\"],\"data\":[\"campaign package and provenance manifest\"],\"api\":[\"content package loader\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"copied expression\",\"licensing approval\",\"new regions\"],\"verification\":\"Validator resolves references and rejects absent provenance.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0004 and human creative/provenance review before implementation.\",\"complexity\":\"high\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0019\",\"title\":\"Add campaign domain invariant and negative-fixture coverage\",\"domain\":\"tests\",\"targets\":[\"shared\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0002\",\"REQ-0003\",\"REQ-0004\",\"NFR-0007\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"Deterministic fixtures cover invalid campaign references, blocked routes, stale commands, and duplicate grants across SHARD-02.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0013\",\"IMP-0014\",\"IMP-0015\",\"IMP-0016\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"tests/core/campaign/fixtures/\",\"tests/core/campaign/invariants*\"],\"data\":[\"negative campaign fixtures\"],\"api\":[\"fixture builders\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"real player data\",\"browser matrix\",\"product assets\"],\"verification\":\"Every fixture is deterministic and each invalid case is detected.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0004 retained for concrete content assumptions.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0020\",\"title\":\"Document SHARD-02 ownership, gates, and handoff boundaries\",\"domain\":\"documentation\",\"targets\":[\"shared\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0001\",\"REQ-0002\",\"REQ-0008\",\"NFR-0012\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"Developer documentation records campaign-domain ownership, explicit gates, asset/provenance handoff, and the UI/PWA boundary for SHARD-03.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0017\",\"IMP-0018\",\"IMP-0019\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"docs/campaign-domain-boundary.md\"],\"data\":[\"SHARD-02 ownership index\"],\"api\":[\"documented handoff\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"UI implementation\",\"PWA delivery\",\"release claims\"],\"verification\":\"Review cross-checks all SHARD-02 contracts and retained gates.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"None; documents GATE-0004 and provenance review without resolving either.\",\"complexity\":\"low\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0021\",\"title\":\"Define shared session and safe checkpoint presentation model\",\"domain\":\"session\",\"targets\":[\"shared\",\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0005\",\"REQ-0006\",\"NFR-0002\",\"NFR-0003\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A framework-neutral session model covers launch, title, new-or-resume, play, pause, ending, focus loss, and confirmed checkpoint state without owning persistence drivers or platform layout.\",\"prerequisites\":[\"IMP-0004\",\"IMP-0006\",\"IMP-0017\"],\"ownership\":{\"files\":[\"src/app/session/\",\"tests/app/session/\"],\"data\":[\"session and checkpoint view state\"],\"api\":[\"session intent and safe-boundary API\"]},\"forbidden_scope\":[\"browser lifecycle implementation\",\"cache refresh\",\"new save schema\",\"network services\"],\"verification\":\"Deterministic tests prove focus loss pauses safely and unconfirmed saves never present as confirmed.\",\"human_external_gate\":\"GATE-0003 and GATE-0004 remain implementation gates for storage and concrete campaign assumptions.\",\"complexity\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"ready_for_authoring\"},\n    {\"id\":\"IMP-0022\",\"title\":\"Define semantic responsive game-shell and navigation contract\",\"domain\":\"ui\",\"targets\":[\"web\",\"pwa\"],\"requirement_ids\":[\"REQ-0007\",\"REQ-0009\",\"REQ-0010\",\"NFR-0004\"],\"bounded_outcome\":\"A semantic shell specifies title, main controls, status, panels, dialogs, visible focus, reflow, and non-colour cues around the shared game state without a