ext equivalent. No chant, anthem, broadcast,\n+club, or game imitation is permitted.\n+\n+| ID | Cue group | Intent |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| AUDIO-001 | Entry and round bed | Restrained, low-distraction electronic percussion with abstract crowd-energy texture; optional and volume-controlled. |\n+| AUDIO-002 | Answer and streak feedback | Brief distinct correct, incorrect, and streak cues using claps and soft brass-like synth accents without sampled sports expression. |\n+| AUDIO-003 | Results and completion | Warm, short celebratory sting that supports rather than replaces the readable results state. |\n+\n+Final durations, quantities, loudness targets, loop policy, and generated-cue\n+selection need production approval; no audio is generated by this plan.\n\ncodex\n{\"status\":\"pass\",\"summary\":\"Normalized product discovery documentation was present and preserved; repaired the deterministic game creative-coverage handoff with scoped football-trivia design, asset, audio, inventory, and ownership records.\",\"changed_files\":[\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-game-design-bible.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/02-game-design-bible.json\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/04-asset-direction.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/specification/04-audio-direction.md\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/implementation-catalogue-index.json\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-production-inventory.json\",\"projects/football-trivia-e2e/planning/game-design-manifest.json\"],\"test_result\":\"PASS: `python3 scripts/runbookgen_validate.py football-trivia-e2e` (3 game, 3 asset, 3 audio IDs declared with owned implementation routes); PASS: `git diff --check`.\",\"evidence\":{\"agent_log\":\"Reviewed the existing normalized brief, domain discovery, game identity, creative direction, and validator. The existing brief documents were retained as the source-normalized discovery output; added only missing continuation artifac